The request contains two separate notifications, and I return exactly one object. Please send them one at a time. For example, I can extract the first one now:

{"to": "polo@example.org", "message": "Hola.", "type": "email"}

Or, if you prefer the SMS first:

{"to": "693-555-666", "message": "Adiós.", "type": "sms"}
